Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was hurt by someone !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, please avenge me !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That prince's lackey escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was investigating, so I chased him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he would have strong backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,He asked a mortal for help
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he injured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,if Fu'er hadn't escaped in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:32.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Master wouldn't have ever seen me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you sure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,that when you saw this cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,he had no spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,as if he were a mortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not mistaken !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, why would I think he's a mortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We haven't walked together in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,See you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master favors Junior Brother too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,when he got in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master would help him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the years, he never refused him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Master's wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could he not understand what Junior Brother was doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder which sect the person who provoked Junior Brother belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess he must be at Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,since he was able to beat Junior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Master's standing in the Four Sect Alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,not to mention a Core Formation cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,even a Nascent Soul cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dared to provoke me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make you pay for it with your life !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Candy animals !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the candy maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much for a candy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,One copper coin is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fu'er was born the year of the monkey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,of course I had to choose this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you like it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:26.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I first met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you were fighting with a bunch of kids over candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe you have already forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I forget ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fu'er lived a hard life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take me to that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's because of the Rain Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Rain Cauldron ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince obtained a precious artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,named the Rain Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The law in the Four Sect Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to gift the Prince any Immortal artifact you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince was betrayed in a moment of carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,He had hidden the Rain Cauldron
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:14.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it was discovered by Zhou Wutai of the White Cloud Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,He ordered to kill the Crown Prince to bury the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince offered to give him the Rain Cauldron
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he couldn't escape death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivators who supported us before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,left us one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had no other choice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but to come and ask for help from Mister Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saved your life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to repay for your 16 years of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will remember it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's the one who hurt me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,how about we have a drink ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sounds good ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good wine !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll gift you the rest of that jug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator's cultivation level is much higher than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire you for living like a mortal to turn into a mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator is turning into a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:09.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,by using the teacher-disciple emotion to understand the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your result is the same as mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't have to admire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems I was not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I heard my disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guessed there was someone in the same realm as me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,that is trying to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't you and I have a competition ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see who will reach the mythical Soul Formation realm first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:38.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interested ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:46.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I feel a sense of competition in my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I will never reach Soul Formation in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,your words are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,very vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,a cultivator of your caliber here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Zhou Wutai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder what fellow cultivator's name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:11.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Within a hundred years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will definitely reach Soul Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will congratulate you early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another vicious word attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If these words plant a seed in my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be a curse for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the years pass and I fail to reach Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will slowly lose my chance to breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I don't have a sudden enlightenment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Zhou is speaking prematurely,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,From my point of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,whether fellow cultivator Zhou can reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But your disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:52.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,will definitely die
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:54.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,within a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mister Wang has a sharp tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:10.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he makes Zhou Wutai angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,what will happen ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,He saw through my relation with Fu'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I'm acting as his teacher and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:23.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is understanding the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,through the teacher-disciple releationship
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to form his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,He raised him with his love,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,his kindness to give him favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,his heart to love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he is plagued with sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:36.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because everything he has done,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is for the sake of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,his teacher-disciple realationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:43.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the day he will finally form his domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,when he will be about to reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be the day he has to kill his disciple himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,By killing the disciple he placed all his heart in,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sorrow will fill his whole being
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,while he takes that last step and reaches Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person's domain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,appears emotionate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but is ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet amidst that ruthlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the emotion of true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,By bringing the hundred year limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,he exposed my true ruthless nature
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the sadness I will feel in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,he left a mark in Fu'er's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,He saw through me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I didn't get a single clue about his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's clever...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:33.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell your king
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to send the Rain Cauldron to my temple in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't pursue this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But your disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,will definitely die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,within a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fu'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't think about it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you eat the candy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master gifted it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I plan to keep it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person shall be my lifelong rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I knew that Mister Wang was an expert !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The White Cloud Sect cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn't dare to help us anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Crown Prince was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with a few words,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,he made this cultivator comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Desperate Emotions Domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Comfort Domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Passing of Time Domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,my domain be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(193,547)}5 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Widow Ceng Si,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:44.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:54.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,excuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The kid doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:57.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,come over for a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:32.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not a cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:34.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you have to enter the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This flower will help your soul in the Reincarnation River
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find a good family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe someone on this waste of a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,can comprehend such a profound Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:44.33,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1547,500)\fad(300,300)}The All-Seer\NTian Yunzi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with your mere Nascent Soul cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's best not to be too greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kind of heavenly Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will take you millions of years to find its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,But your body will already have rotted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you thought of that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the All-Seer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since we met, let's make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can get off this waste of a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,then come find me on planet Tian Yun to become my honorary disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and follow me for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for the All-Seer pushing me back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have lost myself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,to search for the source of the Dao of the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did it !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:33.07,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1555,520)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,After thinking so much, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The passing of time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is just an imitation of the reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's not like a real reincarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still need to pursue my own domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,500}will definitely reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The days of the mortal world always go by quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,To improve his blacksmith business
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Niu annexed 3 other shops nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is thriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Niu also violated his family's rule
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,by passing on his skills to other people, and have them work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:31.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to learn wood carving !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cannot even hold a forge hammer properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:39.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet you want to do fine work like Uncle Wang ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You little rascal !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouch, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't bring you wine today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are getting old, you can't drink every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(200,554)}6 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:24.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excellent bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,his body is made to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will you let me take him in as my disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gladly !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xiao Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter if you don't become an Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can always come back home !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:13.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's snowing !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's snowing !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's getting too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could it be snowing at this time of the year ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.55,Second,,0,0,0,,When it snows, New Year is near !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,stop playing outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's great !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't normal snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has killing intent ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yay it's thundering !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I grow up I want to be an Immortal too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:57.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortals are so powerful !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,A thunder spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a huge restriction here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:23:33.50,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The reincarnation cycle stems from the daoist belief that birth is not the beginning and that death is not the end. When a person dies, their soul leaves their body and enters the Yellow Springs, also known as the underworld, and takes the Reincarnation River to be reborn.\NLife and death in a world governed by the reincarnation cycle are just steps of the soul's journey. Moving on to the next life is just a natural part of the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:59.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:02.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:08.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:08.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:14.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:14.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:17.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:23.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:23.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:29.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:29.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:33.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:33.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:37.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:37.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:41.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:49.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:49.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:56.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.29,0:21:56.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:22:04.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:04.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:13.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:13.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:50.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:50.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:58.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:58.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:07.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:07.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:15.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.17,0:23:15.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
